@host = http://localhost:5112

### ============ BSM ============

### BSM: full message with outbound, onward, bag tag, reconciliation, weight and passenger
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH////123ABC456Z\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.O/LH401/13NOV/MUC/Y\n.N/0220123456001\n.S/Y/12A/B/001/123/Y/N/A\n.W/K/001/20/CM/55/40/20/XYZ\n.P/DOE/JOHN\nENDBSM"}

### BSM: minimum for sortation (V, F, N)
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH\n.F/SR101/18APR/JFK/F\n.N/0085123456003\nENDBSM"}

### BSM: three consecutive bag tags (0220123456, 0220123457, 0220123458)
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LFRA\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/0220123456003\n.P/DOE/JOHN\nENDBSM"}

### BSM: serial wraps from 999999 to 000000 (0220999998, 0220999999, 0220000000, 0220000001)
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LFRA\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/0220999998004\n.P/DOE/JOHN\nENDBSM"}

### BSM: flight lines without a class
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK\n.I/AZ318/11NOV/FCO\n.O/SR1234/18APR/ATL\n.N/0220123456001\n.P/DOE/JOHN\nENDBSM"}

### BSM: flight number with a trailing letter (LH400A)
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH\n.F/LH400A/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/0220123456001\nENDBSM"}

### BSM: digit airline code (4U)
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH\n.F/4U1234/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/0220123456001\nENDBSM"}

### BSM: repeated .E, .R, .G and .Y that BRS does not use (processed, not rejected)
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH////123ABC456Z\n.F/SR101/18APR/JFK/F\n.N/0085123456001\n.P/SMITH/TOM\n.G/25NOV1600/25NOV2200/Willem de Zwijger laan 234\n.G/Zuid Holland/Nederland\n.Y/KL662503/GOLD\n.Y/AB123\n.E/IROP\n.E/UNAC\n.E/RRTE\n.E/STCK\n.R/VIP\n.R/DELAYED INBOUND\n.X//CLR//AT/TSA123\nENDBSM"}

### BSM: invalid .E (processed with a warning in ElementErrors, because BRS does not use .E)
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/0220123456001\n.E/R1\n.P/DOE/JOHN\nENDBSM"}

