POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\nDEL\n.V/1LZRH////123ABC456Z\n.F/SR101/18APR/JFK/C\n.N/0085123457001\n.S/N\nENDBSM"}

### ============ BUM ============

### BUM: one bag
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BUM\n.V/1LPIT////123ABC456Z\n.F/US14/01MAY/MUC/J\n.U/AVE0321US/0012/T/J/MUC\n.N/0037336127001\n.Q/026\n.P/1BROWNE/L\nENDBUM"}

### BUM: two bags in two containers (repeated .U .N .Q .P)
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BUM\n.V/1LPIT////123ABC456Z\n.F/US816/01MAY/FRA/Y\n.U/AVE0321US/0012/T/Y/FRA\n.N/0037336127001\n.Q/026\n.P/WILSON/SARA\n.U/AKV9876US//T/Y/FRA\n.N/0125886172001\n.Q/012\n.P/BROWN/LEE\nENDBUM"}

