POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BUM\n.V/1LFRA////123ABC456Z\n.F/UA941/27MAY/ORD/J\n.N/0016170357001\n.N/0016170421001\nENDBUM"}

### ============ BCM ============

### BCM FOM: flight open, repeated .R
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BCM\nFOM\n.V/1TFRA\n.F/LH3348/20MAR/GVA/J\n.H/T4/GREEN/D46\n.R/FIRST\n.R/SECOND\nENDBCM"}

### BCM FCM: flight closed
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BCM\nFCM\n.V/1TFRA\n.F/LH3348/20MAR/GVA\nENDBCM"}

### BCM DBM: delete baggage data, flight line without destination
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BCM\nDBM\n.V/1LFRA//LH3348007/A/123ABC456Z\n.F/LH3348/20MAR\nENDBCM"}

### ============ Messages that must end as ERROR (accepted with 202, rejected while parsing) ============

### Bad outbound flight line (element error 1001/F_01 with the line)
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH\n.F/LH400\n.N/0220123456001\nENDBSM"}

