POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/022012345\nENDBSM"}

### Bag tag with consecutive count 000
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/0220123456000\nENDBSM"}

### BSM without the mandatory .V
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/0220123456001\nENDBSM"}

### BUM without the mandatory .F
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BUM\n.V/1LPIT\n.N/0037336127001\nENDBUM"}

### BSM with an element that is not part of the BSM (.A)
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/0220123456001\n.A/QF006201/BSM/ACK\nENDBSM"}

### Unknown element line
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.Z/XYZ\n.N/0220123456001\nENDBSM"}

### Message type without a handler
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"XYZ\n.V/1LZRH\nENDXYZ"}

### ============ Messages rejected at intake (HTTP 400 or 413, nothing is stored) ============

### Wrong END line
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/0220123456001\nENDBUM"}

### Header with a space
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM DEL\n.V/1LZRH\n.N/0220123456001\nENDBSM"}

### Too short
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM"}


### ============ Element variants: each of these is processed (PROCESSED) ============

### .V with a message reference and an acknowledgement request
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1TLHR//BA21900123/A\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/0220123456001\nENDBSM"}

### .V with a part number, a reference and an acknowledgement request
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1TDFW/PART1/BA21900123/A\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/0220123456001\nENDBSM"}

### .V with only encryption
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1TCDG////123ABC456Z\n.F/LH400/12NOV/JFK/Y\n.N/0220123456001\nENDBSM"}

### Terminating baggage (source X): .I and no .F
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1XFRA\n.I/KL067/02APR/AMS/F\n.N/0074123456005\nENDBSM"}

