### Lower case header
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"bsm\n.V/1LZRH\n.N/0220123456001\nENDBSM"}

### END line with a trailing space
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BSM\n.V/1LZRH\n.N/0220123456001\nENDBSM "}

### BCM with the wrong END line
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"BCM\nFOM\n.V/1TFRA\n.F/LH3348/20MAR/GVA\nENDBSM"}

### Empty message
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":""}

### Body without a message
POST {{host}}/api/textmessages
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ============ Reading the parsed results ============

### Parsed messages nobody has acknowledged yet
GET {{host}}/api/parsedmessages

### Same, limited to 5 records after id 3
GET {{host}}/api/parsedmessages?limit=5&afterId=3

### Mark parsed messages as consumed
POST {{host}}/api/parsedmessages/consumed
Content-Type: application/json

{"ids":[1,2,3]}
